      <title>AI之眼：Grok如何洞察急诊室的盲区，挽救一条生命</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251205-ai%E4%B9%8B%E7%9C%BCgrok%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E6%80%A5%E8%AF%8A%E5%AE%A4%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%8C%BD%E6%95%91%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%A1%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD/</link>
